'''Igrupan''' is an [[NPC]] who owns a chicken coop in {{Zone|Scarleton}}.

== Igrupan's Chickens ==
{{Main|Igrupan's Chickens}}

== Chickzilla ==
{{main|Chickzilla}}

Chickzilla spawns after the player talks to '''Igrupan''' and completes his quest. The player must have more than {{Reputation|Mage|7,000}}.

